{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Corroder",
  "prompt": "metallic grit bass: a modal resonator rung by a saw, ring-modulated by a carrier whose phase is pushed around by an audio-rate Lorenz attractor, through a split sine-fold and stair-step shaper, then bit-crushed and squashed over a clean sine sub; Corrode goes from a metallic ping to a corroded grind",
